 Frederic Jones    | 20002 |           5
 John Doe          | 10002 |           5
 John Lucas        | 30005 |           5
 John Smith        | 10001 |           5
 Adam Fox          | 20005 |           4
 Andrew K. Smith   | 10008 |           0
 Cristiano Ronaldo | 40002 |           0
(8 rows)

